  "_doc": "Spoken forms for zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural (see references/pronunciation.md). lexicon: whole-token respellings, case-sensitive. parts/acronyms: pieces of snake_case identifiers. patterns: [regex, replacement] applied first. approved: terms confirmed right as the voice reads them (by the user's ear, or by a second ASR when Whisper alone mishears) (pron_check reports them as OK, never respells them). Add an entry only after pron_check.py --asr shows the written form fails and the respelling passes.",
